<view class="page"><view class="hero brand-hero"><view class="eyebrow">NANLIAN TRAINING</view><view class="title">训练管理中心</view><view>训练大纲 · 周训练计划 · 单节训练重点</view></view><view class="loading-state" wx:if="{{loading}}">加载中...</view><block wx:elif="{{data}}"><view class="metrics"><view><text>{{data.metrics.curriculums}}</text><text>训练大纲</text></view><view><text>{{data.metrics.weeklyPlans}}</text><text>周计划</text></view><view><text>{{data.metrics.confirmedPlans}}</text><text>已确认</text></view><view><text>{{data.metrics.sessions}}</text><text>课程</text></view><view><text>{{data.metrics.filledSessions}}</text><text>已填重点</text></view></view><view class="nav"><view data-page="curriculums" bindtap="go"><text>训练大纲</text><text>长期训练方向 ›</text></view><view data-page="training-cycles" bindtap="go"><text>本周训练计划</text><text>主题、重点与会议调整 ›</text></view><view data-page="coach-workbench" bindtap="go"><text>教练工作台</text><text>今日课程和训练重点 ›</text></view></view><view class="section-title">本周训练计划</view><view class="card plan-row" wx:for="{{data.weeklyPlans}}" wx:key="id"><view class="between"><view><view class="plan-title">{{item.className}}</view><view class="muted small">{{item.coachName}} · {{item.weekStart}}—{{item.weekEnd}}</view></view><view class="tag">{{item.statusLabel}}</view></view><view class="theme">本周主题：{{item.mainTheme}}</view><view class="muted small">{{item.focusText}}</view></view><view class="notice">周六线上会议继续在线下进行，小程序只记录讨论后的调整备注。</view></block></view>
